  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ma5CD8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>该模组只有一个简单的目标：完全从游戏中移除配方书。与其他类似的模组不同，它不仅仅是隐藏配方书按钮——NERB 彻底移除了其功能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/npjTQ2F.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>如果你在一个大型整合包中拥有完全解锁的配方书，并运行 <code>/data get entity @s</code> 命令，你会注意到它返回了海量的数据——其中大部分是配方名称。安装此模组后，这些配方名称将被移除，从而显著提升 CraftTweaker 或 KubeJS 等模组的性能（例如在脚本中使用 <code>event.player.data</code> 时）。它还加快了服务器与客户端之间的数据同步速度，并减少了玩家加入世界所需的时间。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>NERB</strong> 提供多种可配置的功能模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>已禁用 (DISABLED)：</strong> 完全从你的物品栏中移除配方书按钮及其默认功能。</li>\n<li><strong>已启用 (ENABLED)：</strong> 保留配方书按钮，但禁用其默认功能，防止通过书籍管理配方。</li>\n<li><strong>已发现 (DISCOVERED)：</strong> 自动解锁配方书中所有可用的配方。在此模式下不应用任何额外优化。</li>\n<li><strong>切换 (TOGGLE)：</strong> 配方书按钮保留在你的物品栏中。它不再切换配方书界面，而是切换 JEI/REI/EMI 界面的可见性。默认的配方书功能仍然被禁用。这是默认选中的模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTSmbVY.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>26.1.2:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=26.1.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Quilt</span> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=26.1.2&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.21.11:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.11&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Quilt</span> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.11&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.21.4:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21.4&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.4&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.21.1:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.20.6:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Quilt</span> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.20.4:&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.20.1:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.19.4: <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.19.2: <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.18.2: <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.17.1: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.17.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.17.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n<li>1.16.5: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.16.5&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.16.5&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n<li>1.15.2: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.15.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.15.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n<li>1.14.4: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.14.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.14.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rNOClDx.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>问：这个模组兼容 X 吗？</strong><br>\n答：在大多数情况下，是的。即使某些模组与 NERB 的部分功能重叠，其余的优化功能仍保持不变并正常工作。</p>\n<p><strong>问：我可以在整合包中使用你的模组吗？</strong><br>\n答：可以，欢迎包含在内。</p>\n<p><strong>问：我可以将你的模组重新上传到其他网站吗？</strong><br>\n答：不可以。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4SbaMTb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/SSKirillSS/nerb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnotenoughrecipebook\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div>\n<p>未定义</p>\n<div><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想尝试我们的其他模组吗？访问 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 获取更多信息！</strong></p></div>",
